{% endfor %}

## Board build (atopile + KiCad)
- `ato build`: **{{ board.ato_build }}**; assertions failing: {{ board.assertions | rejectattr('pass') | map(attribute='name') | join(', ') or "none" }}
- DRC: {{ board.drc.errors }} errors, {{ board.drc.unconnected }} unconnected, {{ board.drc.warnings }} warnings
- Files: `{{ board.files.ato }}`, `{{ board.files.board }}`, `{{ board.files.placement_script }}` (under `build/board/`)

| Attempt | Change | Rules passed | DRC errors |
|---|---|---|---|
{% for o in board.placements %}| {{ o.attempt }} | {{ o.change }} | {{ o.rule_checks | selectattr('pass') | list | length }}/{{ o.rule_checks | length }} | {{ o.drc_errors }} |
{% endfor %}

