## Upload checklist
- [ ] DRC 0 errors, 0 unconnected, run on the same board file that is exported
- [ ] JLC "Parts detected" equals "Parts confirmed", and equals the BOM lines above
- [ ] Every BOM line above is clean; every "do_not_place" part is absent from the JLC BOM and CPL
- [ ] Every polarity row above checked in JLC's 3D view and screenshotted
- [ ] No copper across the break-off line
- [ ] Hash of `build/fab/` logged in `qaqc/UPLOAD_CHECKLIST.md`
